文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p061","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m061-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p061","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m064-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"季文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p064","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m064-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"季文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p064","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[{"era":"BCE","era_year":568,"year":-567,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"五年，季文子卒。家無衣帛之妾，廄無食粟之馬，府無金玉，以相三君。君子曰：『季文子廉忠矣。』","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p064","quote":"五年，季文子卒。家無衣帛之妾，廄無食粟之馬，府無金玉，以相三君。君子曰：『季文子廉忠矣。』","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m064-0003"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記》卷十四〈十二諸侯年表〉數位年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/史記/卷014","quote":"五季文子卒。","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"魯襄公五年對數位年表公元前568年行。公元前年欄為數位編輯參考，不是古文公元紀年；只換算年，未核底本影像或曆表，未知公曆月日不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"record_id":"le-shiji033-045","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","date_role":"life_event","event_type":"death"}],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji033-133","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","surfaces":["季文子","文子"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-033-lu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p056","quote":"十五年，季文子使於晉。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p059","quote":"十八年，宣公卒，子成公黑肱立，是爲成公。季文子曰：『使我殺適立庶失大援者，襄仲。』襄仲立宣公，公孫歸父有寵。宣公欲去三桓，與晉謀伐三桓。會宣公卒，季文子怨之，歸父奔齊。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p061","quote":"十六年，宣伯告晉，欲誅季文子。文子有義，晉人弗許。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p064","quote":"五年，季文子卒。家無衣帛之妾，廄無食粟之馬，府無金玉，以相三君。君子曰：『季文子廉忠矣。』"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p078","quote":"定公立，趙簡子問史墨曰：『季氏亡乎？』史墨對曰：『不亡。季友有大功於魯，受鄪爲上卿，至于文子、武子，世增其業。魯文公卒，東門遂殺適立庶，魯君於是失國政。政在季氏，於今四君矣。民不知君，何以得國！是以爲君慎器與名，不可以假人。』"}],"rationale":"按文公以後立嗣、昭公出奔、夾谷會盟、徵百牢與魯君世系的具體事件及國別暫定異稱，後期同爵稱不與先君混同。身份、匿名指代與數位疑讀待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-roll-close:lun","text":"史臣曰：季孫行父稱見有禮於其君者，如孝子之養父母；無禮於其君者，如鷹鸇之逐鳥雀。是以石碏戮厚，叔向誅鮒，前史以為美譚。王敦之惡，不足矜其類。然而硃家容布，為大俠之首；酈寄載呂，興賣友之譏。亦所以激揚風俗，弘長名教。王彬艤船而厚其所薄，王舒沈江而薄其所厚，較之優劣，斷乎可知。思行、彪之厲風規於多僻之日，虞潭、顧衆徇貞心于危蹙之辰。龍管為出納之端，{制魚}魚非獻替之術，嘯父之對，何其鄙歟！","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-roll-close:lun:m0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"季孫行父","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-roll-close:lun:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"石碏","kind":"person","person_id":"yt0_0mx_ah5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-roll-close:lun:m0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"厚","kind":"person","person_id":"yt0_0mx_ah5_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-roll-close:lun:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"叔向","kind":"person","person_id":"edm_4zm_yh1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-jin076-roll-close:lun:m0050","