":6,"text":"保其榮名者也"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd","book_id":"b-nanqishu-036","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p012","text":"臣聞行父盡忠，無禮斯疾；農夫去草，見惡必耘。所以振纓稱良，登朝著績，未有尸位存私，而能保其榮名者也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p012:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"行父","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"王逡之以魯季文子行父作古例，見左傳文公十八年季文子使大史克答。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p012:u0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"農夫","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"奏引古諺中農夫泛稱。"}],"source_position":{"raw_start":1552,"raw_end":1602,"raw_character_offsets":[1552,1553,1554,1555,1556,1557,1558,1559,1560,1561,1562,1563,1564,1565,1566,1567,1568,1569,1570,1571,1572,1573,1574,1575,1576,1577,1578,1579,1580,1581,1582,1583,1584,1585,1586,1587,1588,1589,1590,1591,1592,1593,1594,1595,1596,1597,1598,1599,1600,1601],"first_line":34,"last_line":34,"revision_id":1492438,"source_layer":"received_biography","projection_sha256":"9dd36550ae35a31a3037bc4c8285578421d67433cc974da7ead2142fa30bf2ce"},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong","book_id":"b-nanqishu-036","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-ws1492438"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p056","text":"十五年，季文子使於晉。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m056-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"季文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p059","text":"十八年，宣公卒，子成公黑肱立，是爲成公。季文子曰：『使我殺適立庶失大援者，襄仲。』襄仲立宣公，公孫歸父有寵。宣公欲去三桓，與晉謀伐三桓。會宣公卒，季文子怨之，歸父奔齊。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m059-0004","start":4,