爲上卿，至于文子、武子，世增其業。魯文公卒，東門遂殺適立庶，魯君於是失國政。政在季氏，於今四君矣。民不知君，何以得國！是以爲君慎器與名，不可以假人。』","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"ath_xsq_n4i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"趙簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"jg7_dpd_2ev","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"史墨","kind":"person","person_id":"3sc_20t_48d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"史墨","kind":"person","person_id":"3sc_20t_48d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"季友","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_ABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"文子","kind":"person","person_id":"y5g_euj_1xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"武子","kind":"person","person_id":"nvt_gxa_pdo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"魯文公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk_BA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"東門遂","kind":"person","person_id":"9rn_poi_ayp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"魯君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m078-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、論贊署稱、地點氏稱或未定指代；不補姓名、爵位與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-